---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Cancellation Policy | Edenva"
  description="Cancellation and refund policy for Edenva Ecological Park tours."
  canonicalPath="/en/cancellation-policy/"
  langSwitchHref="/cancelaciones/"
  h1="Cancellation Policy"
  breadcrumbLabel="Cancellation Policy"
  noindex
>
  <p><em>
    Initial draft — pending review by a lawyer before publishing without a noindex restriction.
  </em></p>

  <h2>Free cancellation</h2>
  <p>
    You can cancel or reschedule your booking free of charge if you notify us at least <strong>24 hours</strong>
    before the scheduled departure time, either via WhatsApp, phone, or directly through the confirmation you
    received from our ticketing provider.
  </p>

  <h2>Last-minute cancellations</h2>
  <p>
    No refunds are issued for cancellations notified less than 24 hours in advance, for no-shows on the day of
    the tour, or for leaving the premises before the tour ends.
  </p>

  <h2>Weather conditions</h2>
  <p>
    Edenva is not responsible for delays caused by weather or traffic conditions during transport. If the park
    must close activities for safety reasons, we will contact you to reschedule or refund your booking.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
